<title>USA: Ballard Medical sets $0.05 semi-annual div.</title>
<headline>Ballard Medical sets $0.05 semi-annual div.</headline>
<dateline>DRAPER, Utah 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballard Medical Products said Wednesday that its board of directors has declared a semi-annual $0.05 a share cash dividend, payable January 3, 1997, to shareholders of record December 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Ballard said it intends to declare a similar dividend in about six months.</p>
<p>The company's previous payout was an annual dividend of $0.08 a share, paid in January of 1996.</p>
</text>
